@startuml sequence_review_jump
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Weekly Focus - Jump to historical week

actor User
participant "Scrubber" as Sc
participant "TileContext" as Ctx
participant "Tile" as T
participant "Controller" as C
participant "API" as API

User -> Sc: Pick date 6 weeks ago
Sc -> Ctx: selectedReviewDate(date)
Ctx -> T: signal change
T -> C: load('review', '<date>')
C -> API: GET /weekly-focus?asOf=<date>
API -> API: Clamp asOf, compute weekStart/End containing asOf
API -> API: Top-3 behaviours by activity count\nin that week, profile-scoped
API --> C: { weekStart, weekEnd, focusAreas } + Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
C --> T: signal updates
T --> User: Tile shows historical week, REVIEW pill

@enduml
